### Auto
path: "py_call_compound.at"
```auto
// PLAN-598 T-05 (P539-D3): compound receivers must emit parenthesized —
// `py_call(1 + 2, "bit_length")` → `(1 + 2).bit_length()`, never
// `1 + 2.bit_length()` (precedence rebinds the call to the last operand).
fn main() {
    let n = py_call(1 + 2, "bit_length")
    print(n)
}
```

